---
import Header from '../../components/header/index.astro'
import SEO from '../../components/seo/index.astro'
import { ClientRouter } from 'astro:transitions'
import '../../style/index.css'
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <SEO title="Work with me" description="Build web and mobile apps, APIs, and developer tools with Emmanuel Obiabo." />
    <ClientRouter />
  </head>
  <body class="editorial-page">
    <Header />
    <main class="page-shell work-content">
      <h1>Bring me the tricky parts.</h1>

      <p>
        I'm Emmanuel. I build web and mobile apps, APIs, and developer tools with TypeScript and Rust.
        I've worked on fintech, blockchain, and AI tools, and I'm open to roles in any field.
      </p>

      <h2>Things I like untangling</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Features that need the screen and the API to agree.</li>
        <li>APIs and SDKs other developers can use without guesswork.</li>
        <li>Integrations with edge cases hiding in plain sight.</li>
      </ol>

      <p class="work-contact">
        Have a problem worth digging into? <a href="/reach">Let's talk</a>.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .work-content {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  ol {
    list-style: decimal;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li + li {
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
  }

  a {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .work-contact {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
</style>
